    "description": "**Sketchfab deletes unused textures from file (season vars for billboards, MRAO vars)!** Uploaded all textures on [Google drive](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1h5BSaebMFbxedcDKRuokD_fvVOyvq2MO?usp=sharing) \n\n\n# Textures\n\nAll models share same texture sets:\n\n* Bark (1024x2048): Base Color, MRAO, Normal.\n\n* Branches (4096k -** 5 sets for summer, early and late autumn, winter, and spring**): Base Color (+Opacity), MRAO, Normal, SS amount.\n\nBillboards have their own texture sets from 1024k to 256. Billboard mat should be set to 1 sided.\n\n# Vertex Color\n\n* R - baked AO\n\n* G - gradient from 0 to 1  (starts at the base and fades out toward the tips)\n\n* B - blend for bark texture\n\n# Polycount (LOD0):\n\n* Large ~19-24k tris (double 37k)\n\n* Big ~10k tris (double 18k)\n\n* Medium ~6k tris\n\n* Small ~1.2k tris\n\n* Sapling ~170 tris\n\n# Other\n\n* **Vertex normals** setted up for more fluffy effect. Dont like it? Clear Custom Normals\n\n* Alt+G move all models to origin (Blender) - use on trees and empties\n\n* Done... (￣﹃￣)",
